  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "马国亮先生在这个月里（六月）给我两封信。",
      "output_sha256": "5c7f7b25dc2ad0d10511b3ebe337e4d04d2fd29089d587f5a57af31f993f6012",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c7f7b25dc2ad0d10511b3ebe337e4d04d2fd29089d587f5a57af31f993f6012",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“文人相重”，我必须说他的信实在写的好：文好，字好，信纸也好，可是，这是附带的话；正文是这么回事：第一封信，他问我的小说写得怎样了？",
      "output_sha256": "2ef7fe495a8b294c7a77198cef96080f100778b3b2e66e6e677f9858ac0dd1ef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "2ef7fe495a8b294c7a77198cef96080f100778b3b2e66e6e677f9858ac0dd1ef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "说起来话长，我在去年春天就向赵家璧先生透了个口话，说我要写一部长篇小说，内中的主角儿是两位镖客，行侠作义，替天行道，十八般武艺件件精通，可是到末了都死在手枪之下。",
      "output_sha256": "54dd440f6ab9bbd9567fb4d8e999a10a885aac895c3a69166e8415a1bb49a2fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "54dd440f6ab9bbd9567fb4d8e999a10a885aac895c3a69166e8415a1bb49a2fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的意思是说时代变了，单刀赴会，杀人放火，手持板斧把梁山上，都已不时兴；二大刀必须让给手枪，而飞机轰炸城池，炮舰封锁海口，才够得上摩登味儿。",
      "output_sha256": "ab0a52bdbf8cc16fb5dcae5051e4661315f97c8aa5ff3fc0523e8b0ded934db8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "ab0a52bdbf8cc16fb5dcae5051e4661315f97c8aa5ff3fc0523e8b0ded934db8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这篇小说，假如能写成了的话，一方面是说武侠与大刀早该一齐埋在坟里，另一方面是说代替武侠与大刀的诸般玩艺不过是加大的杀人放火，所谓鸟枪换炮者是也，只显出人类的愚蠢。",
      "output_sha256": "92024fb1966ee8468f9e98d2e2c7b46ca11aa73765a829eea6e1c796481a51b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "92024fb1966ee8468f9e98d2e2c7b46ca11aa73765a829eea6e1c796481a51b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "春天过去，接着就是夏天，我到上海走了一遭，见着了赵先生。",
      "output_sha256": "6372754ad149082791e4bb6f6c74599b04ce2f128c2b900e424dab0ef57a8023",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "6372754ad149082791e4bb6f6c74599b04ce2f128c2b900e424dab0ef57a8023",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他很愿意把这本东西放在《良友丛书》里。",
      "output_sha256": "e6cccd3fd16f06f83d96e46c52eda0ebb0dc32b21b44092153240bb7177d19e5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "e6cccd3fd16f06f83d96e46c52eda0ebb0dc32b21b44092153240bb7177d19e5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "由上海回来，我就开始写，在去年寒假中，写成了五六千字。",
      "output_sha256": "2c23355f54bcebeea0c4bd7d3891b7f4da717cb1f4e08303b55511e53a2d6dde",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "2c23355f54bcebeea0c4bd7d3891b7f4da717cb1f4e08303b55511e53a2d6dde",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这五六千字中没有几个体面的，开学以后没工夫续着写，就把它放在一边。",
      "output_sha256": "9f2d429711e5c106c890448f70d09e7805b00f6c2e90213596df653293dc25fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "9f2d429711e5c106c890448f70d09e7805b00f6c2e90213596df653293dc25fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大概是今年春天吧，我在一本刊物上看到一个短篇小说，所写的事儿与我想到的很相近。",
      "output_sha256": "2c9d7ed881da50470290c232b5a55d0c966537a8262e4c0de3807e1f7ddb3908",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "2c9d7ed881da50470290c232b5a55d0c966537a8262e4c0de3807e1f7ddb3908",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大家往往思想到同样的事，这本不出奇，可是我不愿再写了。",
      "output_sha256": "289be18fa80f4b7df1ed66f0bf46d45d4da982f0ede8131504ee18aa4db19300",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "289be18fa80f4b7df1ed66f0bf46d45d4da982f0ede8131504ee18aa4db19300",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一方面是因为那几千字写得并不好，另一方面是别人已有所成就，尽管再写可以，但心里总觉得差了那么一口气，最后，我想着在夏天休息一下。",
      "output_sha256": "6f8f4e40a1fad4993506e834c6b450f7139b5d52501057cbfce7366219ec2d8e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.425575,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a7bf1be28bf2c440f1b5607ebde8ae4dc72a06abb8de24d3d2163ca37dff947b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6f8f4e40a1fad4993506e834c6b450f7139b5d52501057cbfce7366219ec2d8e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "马先生所提及的小说，正是指这一部。",
      "output_sha256": "b9121a147a13559464edbd1d2686ef148bcc1c5bb1bf0d98b9d0b54d22cfdfb4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.576691,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "87956d5710977ce230e9c27cbce78672a36f37c0f75d12f2d86cec8587a1d518"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b9121a147a13559464edbd1d2686ef148bcc1c5bb1bf0d98b9d0b54d22cfdfb4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我写信回复他，表示今夏将休息，决定不再继续写。",
      "output_sha256": "43665ae2f9ae60eedb551fd10eb62f1e9201eac680beb0a65102be34641cc03c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.381329,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "121b575adc3025042d47140394183ab5105d56b2d9b991c810ba4faa341f7a53"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "43665ae2f9ae60eedb551fd10eb62f1e9201eac680beb0a65102be34641cc03c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "几天后，他又寄来一封信，依旧是字美、文好、信纸考究；还是“文人相重”的情谊。",
      "output_sha256": "de10acc4487560bcfe2780df2959e59dded60d4d925d38201038ccf7a4bb79bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.528124,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "83b3afc2d0a6fedcfff239c516fbb389b0c2a87efc9e770b6e20a1f7c76a82fb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "de10acc4487560bcfe2780df2959e59dded60d4d925d38201038ccf7a4bb79bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在这封信中，他表示理解并赞赏我应当休息，但在休息之前必须给《良友》写一个短篇。",
      "output_sha256": "3370d1cd5444d2783b9934bf7fff2afd4b182e7248342475e54ab8598ac32add",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.684484,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6b28cf7ab0bb7d37ce8b14e9784421afa0ed16862bd24811797647f0ef4ed761"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3370d1cd5444d2783b9934bf7fff2afd4b182e7248342475e54ab8598ac32add",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "短篇？",
      "output_sha256": "4ef0f399286c6e53355d732f7e5e39602037284b6e0a84e6138b169892b973f3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "4ef0f399286c6e53355d732f7e5e39602037284b6e0a84e6138b169892b973f3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "也不能写！",
      "output_sha256": "4c122387dd74947137333898f41fa5aa66ef9370eb73e235a6e2953e8e0c439e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c122387dd74947137333898f41fa5aa66ef9370eb73e235a6e2953e8e0c439e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "说起来话就又长了。",
      "output_sha256": "d39362646aa28ada80a25e77f0770431b835d825b15a49d3e473927932a2f5a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "d39362646aa28ada80a25e77f0770431b835d825b15a49d3e473927932a2f5a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "春天时我曾答应给其他朋友写些故事，都是计划在暑假完成，因为平日里实在难以抽出“整”的时间。",
      "output_sha256": "1902330fc7972c0b5639eec7a0831e963c1e5a100a0b16205a253f2c11b1ac38",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.494223,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ad1bd4974299c14a8d41f087d9a9e6e5183db1374f86123983d944b00c0df33e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1902330fc7972c0b5639eec7a0831e963c1e5a100a0b16205a253f2c11b1ac38",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "既然决定休息，那么不写就都不写，不能有偏向。",
      "output_sha256": "6e20e6bce300fe66b1397988217569cf3a8043342b0ff2e36754c9f0e74eded6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "6e20e6bce300fe66b1397988217569cf3a8043342b0ff2e36754c9f0e74eded6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而且，我不愿意也不应该对自己失信，接下来就是我想说的重点，请耐心读下去：",
      "output_sha256": "690b1770efd3f6b5d2adf3285c55133ec6a7b5a07f1d2e49b991b6bfcc878eae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.476396,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22,
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "016def2bca93c8eb3fe554fb2a2d3e60a4826f93c68df7545a692ce72a95df45",
        "d97a498261c99edb43ae1d1d9dac5244bc39f070917d6e9d4c93d5a73c63a1bf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "690b1770efd3f6b5d2adf3285c55133ec6a7b5a07f1d2e49b991b6bfcc878eae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我热爱写作，一方面是为了赚钱，另一方面是因为我有这种瘾。",
      "output_sha256": "2e20469774a8f7d2dce9935fad564cb9f6c2841412a8cd3e4f815c432e645c46",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.487959,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "36a110c3e586d154b9d26b8acf93b531b9aaa17e6aaf0022476d565932f27474"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2e20469774a8f7d2dce9935fad564cb9f6c2841412a8cd3e4f815c432e645c46",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我乃性急之人，办事与洗澡具同一风格，西里哗拉一大回，永不慢腾腾的，对于作文，也讲快当；但作文到底不是洗澡，虽然回回满头大汗，可是不见得能回回写得痛快淋漓。",
      "output_sha256": "602a1e34ee7a9c0a761795d549d2afefa5f956ec648b31babee2ef33748262bf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "602a1e34ee7a9c0a761795d549d2afefa5f956ec648b31babee2ef33748262bf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "只有在这种时候，就是写完一篇或一段而觉得不满意的时候，我才有耐心，修改，或甚至从头另写。",
      "output_sha256": "fae9bc73296a8784fe38f1f225cb36fef6ebf8466811362b0b3882bc0b397972",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "fae9bc73296a8784fe38f1f225cb36fef6ebf8466811362b0b3882bc0b397972",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这种耐心源自于我对写作的渴望。",
      "output_sha256": "d3adcf8126e9584bf65f7282d93c8abb749281df8a79e0f6fc8fe347e6876c96",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.277802,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "075d0694d9c74fc4bf1cfe8e74f8d7b9558f68488917822861094757fc0e2074"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d3adcf8126e9584bf65f7282d93c8abb749281df8a79e0f6fc8fe347e6876c96",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "大概有八年没有在暑假休息过，整年之中，只有暑假是我写作的最佳时机，能够一气呵成写下十几万字。",
      "output_sha256": "42a15fc1287991f5c653ec8b50c5e7de4c1d7ea57f46bf3c9ec6c4443f63a282",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.631212,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d72c63d5b02e7b4b53c710b88eb8c54fbc544548eb530ad6850bd783af03ee4c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "42a15fc1287991f5c653ec8b50c5e7de4c1d7ea57f46bf3c9ec6c4443f63a282",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "暑天自然是很热了，我不怕；天热，我的心更热，老天爷也得被我战败，因为我有瘾呀。",
      "output_sha256": "cbe2945767113dd48d839a5226b2fd9f3117568342e8e16e5e9688efd094aff1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "cbe2945767113dd48d839a5226b2fd9f3117568342e8e16e5e9688efd094aff1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自幼儿我的身体就很弱，这个瘾自然不会使身体强壮起来。",
      "output_sha256": "070402091e35a7c956b5f6338f3587255eadd49b17b6d90740eb2c7f72ae4233",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "070402091e35a7c956b5f6338f3587255eadd49b17b6d90740eb2c7f72ae4233",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "胃病，肺病，头疼，肚疼，什么病都闹过。",
      "output_sha256": "586a7031f5bdf9bf1adaf13a978836995f38075e31df941bf3ea2271afcd3afc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "586a7031f5bdf9bf1adaf13a978836995f38075e31df941bf3ea2271afcd3afc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "以肺病为例，我曾经历过七八期的折磨。",
      "output_sha256": "9af5dcbac027b8ec88221fd352f4ee74e17f75e994150188ce632ed9a51b7b63",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.46,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d0cb1c77ba65952334c4e8a5bcad8587ffad1d8f388edf3cdd5d3f8f67b959c9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9af5dcbac027b8ec88221fd352f4ee74e17f75e994150188ce632ed9a51b7b63",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "过犹不及，没吃药，没休息它自己好了。",
      "output_sha256": "dbb4d9d6710d3ed05820a9b4a0dadb5ed100099680d286d6c0e4218637a2c091",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "dbb4d9d6710d3ed05820a9b4a0dadb5ed100099680d286d6c0e4218637a2c091",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "胃病也很严重，曾有位不收我诊金的医生说我的胃已经掉了一大块。",
      "output_sha256": "45882ddc5bdd2efbb00ddbf6bc041e4f63ab6b9e2f0a12d2d3728ed4c7b0feb4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.665067,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3c1a04c6881d811e7e6936247e924e03ab0d90f357bfa032cbd5d1b0f188c310"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "45882ddc5bdd2efbb00ddbf6bc041e4f63ab6b9e2f0a12d2d3728ed4c7b0feb4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我当时非常慌张，若继续这样下去，胃说不定会从肚子掉出来，必得吃药。",
      "output_sha256": "20301a535d402b79e3021149f06e3d29cd14c17fd37032953df25e98b9223331",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.39638,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35,
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "634d49d83c48f500762a37e63c9c98db661be3e6e4e43a1b5fdc7c449405b4b4",
        "04485497e9ece51941d507e5b62d9139456f22fbd8aef8747322f68663366610"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "20301a535d402b79e3021149f06e3d29cd14c17fd37032953df25e98b9223331",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而药真的有效，喝了一瓶，胃竟然又恢复了原位，像气球一样往上升，我由衷感到欣慰。",
      "output_sha256": "bebaa7f3f2011ae31048c0e14d299accb0a75e88d21f8fb47ad4b2188bf654cd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.527034,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1a9afc4023fc20bea1c209447a5af191693d0597b4429f0273e6f045f7a85088"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bebaa7f3f2011ae31048c0e14d299accb0a75e88d21f8fb47ad4b2188bf654cd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "虽然闹过这些病，我可是没死过一回。",
      "output_sha256": "bd45b744a1544949954fdbfedc5f8dd5e314dbf0e931dac21f855087365aa762",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "bd45b744a1544949954fdbfedc5f8dd5e314dbf0e931dac21f855087365aa762",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这个，又不能不说是“写瘾”的好处了。",
      "output_sha256": "94a385cc0614378f4f7479dcf8986cfdefccfd1d4d41ebe565cda1f7dfe4efa9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "94a385cc0614378f4f7479dcf8986cfdefccfd1d4d41ebe565cda1f7dfe4efa9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "写作使我胃弱，心跳，头疼；同时也使我小心。",
      "output_sha256": "5496c9dc97978d2818b6435a2c850eaa54e80b3d8c9ea6de99ff368c1d805776",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "5496c9dc97978d2818b6435a2c850eaa54e80b3d8c9ea6de99ff368c1d805776",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "该睡就去睡，该运动就去运动；吃喝起卧差不多都有规律。",
      "output_sha256": "6ccaac2809b55d556acb747edcade71ba393e8697c712d2c0cd67e15a4db32aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "6ccaac2809b55d556acb747edcade71ba393e8697c712d2c0cd67e15a4db32aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "于是虽病而不至于死；就是不幸而死，也是卫生的。",
      "output_sha256": "7b9aa512f7089b4abdc7fb4141984317460888554071facb71a8117abe37c91a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "7b9aa512f7089b4abdc7fb4141984317460888554071facb71a8117abe37c91a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "真的，为满足这个瘾，我一点也不敢大意，决不敢去瞎胡闹，虽然不是不想去瞎胡闹。",
      "output_sha256": "be5ba137f0fdde4f6394a393c496abbd223cd38599f02d7ba9f513f740e357cf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "be5ba137f0fdde4f6394a393c496abbd223cd38599f02d7ba9f513f740e357cf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因此，身体虽弱，可是心中有个老底儿——我的八字儿好，不至于短命。",
      "output_sha256": "31279335441d085de8c6f349701594e5d9a5abdf68b5c1eddfd6b4193a12e731",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "31279335441d085de8c6f349701594e5d9a5abdf68b5c1eddfd6b4193a12e731",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我维持住了生活的平衡：弱而不至作不了事，病而不至出大危险，如薄云掩月，不明亦不极暗。",
      "output_sha256": "2d9605ec096d3e3d0dfdd9d342133ef2745271482f4cd38d90a016d50babdb54",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "2d9605ec096d3e3d0dfdd9d342133ef2745271482f4cd38d90a016d50babdb54",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "就是在这种境界中，八年来在作事之外还写了不少的东西！",
      "output_sha256": "8f52766d6c184b683975f7ef392f2b077170eee1e9acf4ba9edd25b44fde4acf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "8f52766d6c184b683975f7ef392f2b077170eee1e9acf4ba9edd25b44fde4acf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不论好坏，总算过了一把瘾。",
      "output_sha256": "68e266290e2177dc208d58f1a9110d1ec284bb73a9857c6c6d7dc3ee184f8212",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.526705,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "42decd45288c3896b18992a81c138778f41bb0fa7159959d59491fb22ceaa718"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "68e266290e2177dc208d58f1a9110d1ec284bb73a9857c6c6d7dc3ee184f8212",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "近来我吃饭很香，走路很有劲，睡得也很实在；可是有一样，我写不上劲儿来。",
      "output_sha256": "e1924c724f2030604465a6407000920a881ec8efec51de27d8593f22977781ce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "e1924c724f2030604465a6407000920a881ec8efec51de27d8593f22977781ce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "莫非八期肺病又回来了？",
      "output_sha256": "c135348caeedbb65a31aa33230592dde4eccdfa80dd6210b364f2f43757d1856",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "c135348caeedbb65a31aa33230592dde4eccdfa80dd6210b364f2f43757d1856",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不至于吧：我吃得香，睡得好，说话也有力，怎么会是肺病呢！？",
      "output_sha256": "3c881629f46bd5ca4e93d69539af1f17a2a722c64c5d5b7cd375fd9622b2b182",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.683075,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cb17e2473f049c2e4923abd685b4f8d7529b60f854c1617f568fd58eaafc0d00"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3c881629f46bd5ca4e93d69539af1f17a2a722c64c5d5b7cd375fd9622b2b182",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "可能是疲惫了吧，毕竟八年没有休息，谁能不出点毛病呢？",
      "output_sha256": "2670e51dcf1a373f94cb026f55a59100a75394d7089eea4bbedf07d165b738e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.429585,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9563d3cce52a1d01f84f3550bd9936696fa28ae5a5869e943d129ad079dc20b3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2670e51dcf1a373f94cb026f55a59100a75394d7089eea4bbedf07d165b738e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "好吧，今年就决定休息一回，何必与自己较劲呢。",
      "output_sha256": "2cfa331b1abd5dc84bbff33052b6393274f33cc2fa6f71a2b492a90b59eded9c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.561923,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c7ae9ce3177cfcc793839c189237a66fc98fc6d5eb77fb2229cbf2e64b89168b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2cfa331b1abd5dc84bbff33052b6393274f33cc2fa6f71a2b492a90b59eded9c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "长篇短篇一概不写，就像骆驼到口外“放青”，等到秋天再继续干活。",
      "output_sha256": "89184636d5e4ccee68cfd84fa0ca54bb045546e8c9c14e517ecc7d4dfb081c62",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.682215,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2f5210da9adabca72fd2d88891f0922b9455ba46a854beeb7dc005c10fd5acab"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "89184636d5e4ccee68cfd84fa0ca54bb045546e8c9c14e517ecc7d4dfb081c62",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "此外，今年我住在青岛，不休息一番也对不起那美丽的青山绿水。",
      "output_sha256": "6a4f7b64837238e6153ef530ea2a23d1250013d80a232813a43be8a037eefd8d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.734132,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d7a5675d7e7751fd89dbdb940113b6ef31f467d341d188ab945a086d4aeed842"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6a4f7b64837238e6153ef530ea2a23d1250013d80a232813a43be8a037eefd8d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "就此马上休息去者！",
      "output_sha256": "6bec377d915658ba0f859d20f01c2aad24148b9ce82dcb0997571c485af9b118",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "6bec377d915658ba0f859d20f01c2aad24148b9ce82dcb0997571c485af9b118",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "马先生和我都想要短篇，但这次我不能再对自己失信，既然说要休息，就必须去休息。",
      "output_sha256": "4f86e6493f579a118d8024239fd4b18e9ea7fa8f472b5b38060a52ef54ffa8a4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.621251,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56,
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6841160c13a0c91c032c7025e12236f857fce2222742c2b815ff2ea640ddcbf7",
        "9ee3f3d7cd581df2ac0397e7039735a41aa36525f9841536b1a5f1e53ec7218b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4f86e6493f579a118d8024239fd4b18e9ea7fa8f472b5b38060a52ef54ffa8a4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "把这点经过随便的写在这里，马先生要是肯闭闭眼，把这个硬算作一篇小说，那便真感激不尽了，就手儿也对读者们说一声，假若几个月里见不到我的文字，那并非就是我已经死去，我是在养神呀。",
      "output_sha256": "0976cbad1409769c4dfc7c3192fa675411564b30212e7ec0d66844ef79b08cbc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "0976cbad1409769c4dfc7c3192fa675411564b30212e7ec0d66844ef79b08cbc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "代柬：",
      "output_sha256": "550c73cd8200b63f8284992433f2a3178106d0af2019362cc1d03c4a80d3a7b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "550c73cd8200b63f8284992433f2a3178106d0af2019362cc1d03c4a80d3a7b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "老舍先生：你的稿子不能当小说，虽然我闭了几次眼。",
      "output_sha256": "5a82875fdf4a9d6dd646a2d21e3b4b2c948fb6ef9dff271646cb38d56abe5ee6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "5a82875fdf4a9d6dd646a2d21e3b4b2c948fb6ef9dff271646cb38d56abe5ee6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可确是一篇很切题的消夏随笔，所以正好在这里发表。",
      "output_sha256": "5988665e67c964d2ed92b875f4f54429fcc2955003255aa159d1b5aad8a7c4e5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "5988665e67c964d2ed92b875f4f54429fcc2955003255aa159d1b5aad8a7c4e5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你说的长篇是赵先生向你要的，我要的却不是那个。",
      "output_sha256": "6770619f539d9da62726feaa554720aa92cd2612b80eab270cc8ec315d881982",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
